{"reviewId": "388091364_876tjRHsc", "review": {"abstract": "我们应该客观地认识美元重返贬值之路后，世界经济和资源品价格所受的影响。短期内，标价因素的确可能会导致资源品价格上升甚至创出新高，但长期看，经济衰退对资源需求和价格的作用会更加深远。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "chapterUid": 8, "content": "复杂的是，需要叠加康波周期新一轮技术革命，美国想拖到康波周期回升期，对冲掉美元超发的不利，从而消除泡沫，消除衰退，那么大宗商品将在横盘后继续上涨至鼎盛。反之ai技术带来的增长不够快，将会迎来一轮短暂衰退再开启新一轮周期，大宗商品有个骤降再回升。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "21083-21173", "createTime": 1771739810, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 8, "reviewId": "388091364_876tjRHsc", "userVid": 388091364, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "author": {"userVid": 388091364, "name": "山山", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/YsIttiaefQf6wib4iaWjQg00EI4I76jJDB9iaoO3czRribGchibu3haLHGKZ3fRbFdbTkXMzsc5cHTtuXpd2ApaUJudnQRs3GheOckmPImemb55Ac/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 15, "likes": [{"userVid": 285814378, "name": "小亮同学", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEIs8ecAUn8XqWMO3Wpp2LoKNv4CBuakuEuj9FqMJibOwHkicOnnvrCUCOBflqYYiaeZQy05c8F5UgZDzXibHWDL1ib7DiaTYJOuspfnYdmnN8cOd07g/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deep